[00:11.68]1. Welcome to all who gather here this day
[00:32.22]To hear God’s Word and to learn his way.
[00:41.48]Life-giving truth he offers to us all;
[00:48.30]With thankfulness of heart, we respond to his call.
[01:06.32]2. Thanks to our God for brothers such as these,
[01:13.62]Who welcome us and who seek to please.
[01:22.82]May we keep holding men of that sort dear,
[01:29.66]And now we welcome others who meet with us here.
[01:56.14]3. God’s invitation reaches all mankind,
[02:03.62]That all sincere ones the truth may find.
[02:12.52]God by his Son has drawn us to His side.
[02:19.70]So welcome one another with hearts opened wide.
